 Healthy smell reactions retain their1600ms lean-back and hand gesture while smaller appendage arcs recoil and settle. Use damped follow-through with Bun largest, Mochi soft and Sprout restrained. Cancel lateral torso translation at both horizontal ground contacts so the feet stay planted. Preserve primary torso/arms/gaze/expression/blinks/shadow and all other actions, sick/reduced frames, routing and dialogue.
 
 Wardrobe Rest uses the same grounded 2400ms reaction as the resident and environmental rest, with the existing finite preview clock. It retains outfit slots and feet, adds no reward accent, and follows Stop, pose cancellation, outfit updates, hidden deadlines and system/device motion reduction. Five movement choices use balanced 3+2 rows when labels fit; cramped enlarged text switches the wardrobe to page scrolling with readable art and wrapped pose/category controls.
